.el .ds Aq '
.TH edit 1  "edit " 
.SH NAME
edit \- Edit a snippet in $EDITOR; invalid edits are rolled back. An `owner/name` reference edits your cloud snippet and pushes the result as a new version after confirmation
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBedit\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Edit a snippet in $EDITOR; invalid edits are rolled back. An `owner/name` reference edits your cloud snippet and pushes the result as a new version after confirmation
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Snippet name
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  fg edit ubuntu\-setup
  fg edit alice/deploy
